{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひげ☆～（ゝ。∂）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたらもう九月半ば！\n(少し盛ったけど...(笑))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私今年の夏は結構満喫したよっ✳︎\n写真とともに振り返ろう♡(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャンプしたでしょーっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈と花火行ったでしょーっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ言えないけど\nあるお仕事で熱海行ったでしょーっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りさこと純奈と\nディズニー行ったでしょーっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンスアポンアタイムっていうのを\n見たくて行ったんだけど、\n人気だからなかなか\nチケット当たらないのね？( •́ ⍨ •̀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\n2列目が当たったんだあああ♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで第42話のブログのタイトルで\n運を使い果たしたと\n言っていたわけですよ(・ω・́)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣も着られて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいものも食べられて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブもたくさん出来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プール行けなかったこと以外は\n悔いのない夏だったなあ～✳︎(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから私の大好きな\n秋に突入だ( ◞･౪･)◞( ◞･౪･)◞( ◞･౪･)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/08/7413697/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃん個人ぶろぐなったから\nそろそろ女の子向け記事も\nみたいなーーーー(*´･o･｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！そうなの！\n需要わずかだと思うけど(笑)\n一回くらいやりたいなって思ってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにか女の子系の質問あれば\nどーぞーーーー！(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、私女子力すごく低いから\n回答期待しないでね(๑°︿°